 CBRefresh args
⍝ Re-read the two server-wide views. Explicitly on demand rather than on a
⍝ Timer, so tests control exactly when the snapshot is taken and never race
⍝ a background refresh.
⍝
⍝ REFRESHN is bumped LAST, on purpose. A test watching CLONES alone cannot
⍝ distinguish the previous value from a freshly-written identical one, so it
⍝ waits on this counter instead — and because WebSocket frames are applied in
⍝ order, a new counter means the captions below are already in place.

 'F1.CLONES'eWS'Caption'(cloneList ⍬)
 'F1.CLOSELOG'eWS'Caption'(closeList ⍬)

 refreshes←refreshes+1
 'F1.REFRESHN'eWS'Caption'(⍕refreshes)
